","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1086222/000108622226000022/akam-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Since 1998, Akamai has developed and provided solutions for global enterprises to build, secure and accelerate their applications and digital experiences. As of December 31, 2025, our massively distributed global infrastructure was comprised of core and distributed compute sites, more than 4,300 edge points-of-presence in over 130 countries and approximately 700 cities, and our underlying global network integrated with roughly 1,200 network partners. With this scale and distribution, Akamai has visibility and insight into traffic volumes, congestion, attack patterns, vulnerabilities and other activities across the internet's complex intersections of networks and systems. Leveraging these insights, Akamai offers solutions designed to protect our customers from threats and attacks, along with full-stack compute solutions to build and deliver high-performance, low-latency applications acros","zh":"自 1998 年以來，Akamai 一直為全球企業開發並提供解決方案，以建立、保護和加速其應用程式和數位體驗。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們大規模分散式的全球基礎設施由核心和分散式運算站點、遍布 130 多個國家和約 700 個城市的 4,300 多個邊緣接入點以及與約 1,200 個網路合作夥伴整合的底層全球網路組成。憑藉這種規模和分佈，Akamai 可以洞察並深入了解互聯網複雜的網路和系統交叉點的流量、擁塞、攻擊模式、漏洞和其他活動。利用這些見解，Akamai 提供旨在保護客戶免受威脅和攻擊的解決方案，以及用於建置和交付高效能、低延遲應用程式的全端運算解決方案"},{"en":"Today, billions of people go online to work, learn, shop, bank, communicate and more. We firmly believe that the internet's role in transforming the way we exchange ideas and information and conduct business is more vital than ever, especially as those interactions are increasingly driven by AI. Our strategy is to help continue to power and protect business online by offering security, compute, delivery and AI infrastructure services with the industry-leading reliability, scale and expertise our customers need to grow their business with confidence.","zh":"如今，數十億人上網工作、學習、購物、辦理銀行業務、交流等。我們堅信，互聯網在改變我們交換思想和資訊以及開展業務的方式方面的作用比以往任何時候都更加重要，特別是當這些互動越來越多地由人工智慧驅動時。我們的策略是透過提供安全、運算、交付和人工智慧基礎設施服務，以及客戶充滿信心地發展業務所需的行業領先的可靠性、規模和專業知識，幫助繼續推動和保護線上業務。"},{"en":"We provide solutions in three core offerings: security, cloud computing and delivery. We also provide services and support for our customers as they utilize our solutions. As AI is a major focus of corporate initiatives for enterprises across the globe, we are committed to helping our customers seize on its power and potential. We provide cloud computing infrastructure that they can use to build low-latency, AI-powered applications; cybersecurity solutions, powered by adaptive AI and automation, designed to defend against prompt injections, data exfiltration and toxic outputs; generative AI to improve the speed and efficiency of identifying and investigating malicious or suspicious activity; and throughput on our global intelligent network to enable the large volumes of data required to power AI-powered applications and facilitate effective real-time protections.","zh":"我們提供三個核心產品的解決方案：安全性、雲端運算和交付。我們也為客戶使用我們的解決方案提供服務和支援。由於人工智慧是全球企業計畫的主要焦點，我們致力於幫助我們的客戶抓住人工智慧的力量和潛力。我們提供雲端運算基礎設施，他們可以使用它們來建立低延遲、人工智慧驅動的應用程式；由自適應人工智慧和自動化提供支援的網路安全解決方案，旨在防禦快速注入、資料外洩和有毒輸出；生成式人工智慧，提高識別和調查惡意或可疑活動的速度和效率；我們的全球智慧網路的吞吐量，可支援人工智慧的應用程式所需的大量資料並促進有效的即時保護。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our customers include many of the world's leading corporations, such as adidas, Adobe, Aflac, Airbnb, Asus, Autodesk, Bank of Montreal, Carnival Corporation, Comcast, Commerzbank, Daiwa Institute of Research, eBay, Electronic Arts, Epic Games, Fidelity Investments, Honda, Japan Airlines, Liberty Mutual, Maersk Transportation & Logistics, Marriott, NBCUniversal, Panasonic, Panera Bread, Paramount Global, Philips, Rabobank, Riot Games, Sony Interactive Entertainment, RTL, Spotify, Telefonica, Toshiba, Ubisoft, WarnerMedia and The Washington Post. We also actively sell to government agencies. As of December 31, 2025, our public-sector customers included the U.S. Department of Defense, the U.S. Department of Labor, the U.S. Department of Transportation and the U.S. Department of the Treasury.","zh":"我們的客戶包括許多世界領先的公司，如阿迪達斯、Adobe、Aflac、Airbnb、華碩、Autodesk、蒙特利爾銀行、嘉年華公司、康卡斯特、德國商業銀行、大和研究所、eBay、藝電、Epic Games、富達投資、本田、日本航空、Liotiberty Mutual、馬士基運輸、Uni-Ronk、Gra、Uni、R Games、索尼互動娛樂、RTL、Spotify、西班牙電信、東芝、育碧、華納媒體和華盛頓郵報。我们还积极向政府机构销售。截至2025年12月31日，我們的公共部門客戶包括美國國防部、美國勞工部、美國交通部和美國財政部。"},{"en":"No customer accounted for 10% or more of total revenue for any of the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023. Less than 10% of our total revenue in each of the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023 was derived from contracts or subcontracts terminable at the election of the federal government.","zh":"截至2025年12月31日、2024年及2023年的任何年度，沒有客戶佔總收入的10%或以上。截至2025年12月31日、2024年和2023年的每年，我們總收入的不到10%來自可依聯邦政府選舉終止的合約或分包合約。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The market for our solutions is intensely competitive and characterized by rapidly changing technology, evolving industry standards and frequent new product and service innovations. We expect competition for our offerings to increase both from existing competitors and new market entrants. We compete primarily on the basis of:","zh":"我們的解決方案市場競爭激烈，其特點是技術日新月異、行業標準不斷發展以及新產品和服務創新頻繁。我們預期現有競爭對手和新市場進入者對我們產品的競爭將會加劇。我们的竞争主要基于："},{"en":"We compete with companies offering products and services that provide internet content delivery and hosting services, security and cloud computing solutions, technologies used by carriers to improve the efficiency of their systems, streaming content delivery services and equipment-based solutions for internet performance problems, such as load balancers and server switches. Other companies offer online distribution of digital media assets through advertising-based billing or revenue-sharing models that may represent an alternative method for charging for the delivery of content and applications over the internet. In addition, existing and potential customers may decide to purchase or develop their own hardware, software or other technology solutions rather than rely on a third-party provider like us. Our security solutions compete with those offered by both hardware and software provider","zh":"我們與提供互聯網內容交付和託管服務、安全和雲端運算解決方案、營運商用於提高系統效率的技術、串流內容交付服務以及針對互聯網性能問題的基於設備的解決方案（例如負載平衡器和伺服器交換機）的產品和服務的公司競爭。其他公司透過廣告為基礎的計費或收入共享模式提供數位媒體資產的線上分發，這可能代表了透過網路交付內容和應用程式收費的另一種方法。此外，現有和潛在客戶可能決定購買或開發自己的硬體、軟體或其他技術解決方案，而不是依賴像我們這樣的第三方供應商。我們的安全解決方案可與硬體和軟體供應商提供的解決方案競爭"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":2139173000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":2069002000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":4208175000}},"peers":["FFIV","NTAP","VRSN","ADSK","CIEN"]}}